  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/9c/Eternal_Spring_Flag.png/revision/latest?cb=20160905215329\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Eternal Spring Flag\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/9c/Eternal_Spring_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20160905215329\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"99\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Eternal Spring Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Eternal_Spring_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Eternal_Spring_Flag.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The Eternal Spring Empire was an unrecognized breakaway confederacy that existed for 20 days, from the 4th to 24th of December of 2149. The Empire comprised mainly of the Eternal Spring O'Neil colony ship and its confederated colonies that declared secession and warred against the United States during the <a href=\"/wiki/Eternal_Spring_Revolt\" title=\"Eternal Spring Revolt\">Eternal Spring Revolt</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081104\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:3